      "writtenOn": "2015-08-18T00:16:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, you\u0027re right.\n\nHowever, if R1 is unaligned, then wouldn\u0027t the MOVW.P instruction at line 231 also cause a problem?\n\nAlso, you\u0027re copying the 8 bytes to a scratch area on the stack, I think. But doesn\u0027t the MOVM.IA.W at line 227 just copy to a different scratch area on the stack?",
      "parentUuid": "64591d73_95abf35c",
      "revId": "02ec784e5e29b4ec912c1d8e8d36c860ecb8bf93",
      "serverId": "62eb7196-b449-3ce5-99f1-c037f21e1705",
